@sheet Data
-Amount-Qty-
| 3 | 1 |
| 4 | 2 |
| 5 | 3 |

@sheet CalcA
-Metric-Value-
| Sum amount | =SUM(!!Amount) |

@sheet CalcB
-Metric-Value-
| Sum qty | =SUM(!!Qty) |
| Ratio | =SUM(!!Amount)/SUM(!!Qty) |

@sheet Final
-Metric-Value-
| Combined | =CalcA!B2+CalcB!B2 |
| Ratio x10 | =CalcB!B3*10 |
